menu "USB keyboard"

    config USB_KEYBOARD_MEDIA_KEYS
        bool "Media keys (second HID interface)"
        default y
        help
            Add a Consumer Control HID interface, after the boot keyboard
            interface, so volume, mute and playback keys reach the host.
            The keyboard interface itself is unchanged, so BIOS and KVM
            keyboard emulation still see a plain boot keyboard. Disable if a
            KVM or host refuses composite devices.

endmenu
